// Enterprise component library: full matrices on a three-tier token set
// Shows: components bound only to role and component tokens, so all four themes work with no edits; a button set of Kind x State x Size (125 variants) where one size is built and the rest are derived with addVariant and bound to size tokens; a focus ring made of the focus and focus-inset tokens; text-input states including invalid and read-only; tags in two sizes on tag tokens; notifications on notification tokens; table header and row sets in five densities, rows with a text property per cell and an exposed nested status tag; application chrome (header, side navigation, toolbar, batch actions, pagination) as components; the kit previewed in White and Gray 100. Icons are Lucide stand-ins, not Carbon icons
// in: 10-token-sets/48-ibm-carbon-four-themes-with-component-tokens
// The library is born here: name the file now, because a published library takes the file's name.
